---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro"
import HeroMedia from "../../components/HeroMedia.astro"
import SectionHeader from "../../components/SectionHeader.astro"
import FullWidthText from "../../components/FullWidthText.astro"
import TextImageRow from "../../components/TextImageRow.astro"
import MediaGrid from "../../components/MediaGrid.astro"
import PageTitle from "../../components/PageTitle.astro"
---

<Layout>
    <div class="content">


        <PageTitle 
         title="Anomaly - VFX Short Film"
         />

        <HeroMedia
            src="/media/Anomaly_CG.mp4"
            alt="Anomaly CG"
            type="video"
            />

        <FullWidthText>
            <p>
            <br>
            Anomaly was my end-of-second-year film, created at the University of Hertfordshire. On the project, 
            I was responsible for developing and maintaining our CG pipeline, producing the lighting for all CG
            shots, and overseeing the rendering process.
            <br><br>

            As a Pipeline TD, my aim was to enable my team to work in a familiar and comfortable and familiar DCC
            environment while maintaining a consistent workflow across every department.
            <br><br>

            As a Lighting TD, my focus was on building a sense of suspense, revealing just enough to draw the 
            viewer's attention without breaking the mystery before the creature's final reveal.
            <br><br>
            </p>
        </FullWidthText>
    
    </div>
</Layout>

